WEBVTT

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:21.220
Mom?

00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:23.830
Hello, Mom?

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:25.900
Yuno? Good morning.

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:27.040
Good morning.

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:29.000
Why are you calling so early in the morning?

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.140
I thought you'd be up.

00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:32.810
You have school, don't you?

00:00:32.810 --> 00:00:36.750
That's right, but I finish at noon today.

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:38.110
Oh, is that so? In that case...

00:00:38.110 --> 00:00:39.480
Yunocchi, let's go to school!
Oh, is that so? In that case...

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:42.720
Yunocchi, let's go to school!
Oh, Miya-chan came.

00:00:42.720 --> 00:00:43.920
Coming!

00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:47.420
Oh, well, go work hard.

00:00:47.420 --> 00:00:49.720
I will, talk to you later!

