00:15:38.970 --> 00:15:40.600
Yeah!

00:15:53.090 --> 00:15:54.820
Is that a caterpillar?

00:15:54.820 --> 00:15:56.060
That's right.

00:15:56.060 --> 00:15:59.730
It came with the vegetables you sent me.

00:15:59.730 --> 00:16:02.930
I'm trying to raise it into a butterfly.

00:16:02.930 --> 00:16:04.160
I see...

00:16:04.160 --> 00:16:06.770
You must be looking forward to what kind
of butterfly it will turn into.

00:16:06.770 --> 00:16:08.390
Yeah!

00:16:16.110 --> 00:16:17.040
Yuno, the thing hanging from your ceiling...

00:16:17.040 --> 00:16:18.110
