00:17:26.150 --> 00:17:28.770
You should have told me!

00:17:30.150 --> 00:17:31.980
That smells good!

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:35.460
I made plenty, share it with everyone.

00:17:35.460 --> 00:17:37.750
Thank you, Mom.

00:17:39.360 --> 00:17:43.700
Honey, we have some time until the
train comes. Let's get going.

00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:45.320
Yeah!

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:48.630
I see...

00:17:50.070 --> 00:17:53.700
Oh yeah! Could you wait for me downstairs?

00:17:58.440 --> 00:17:59.710
It's open?

00:17:59.710 --> 00:18:02.680
No one lives in this room, right?

00:18:04.650 --> 00:18:07.320
I wonder who uses it?

00:18:07.320 --> 00:18:08.950
Who knows?

00:18:10.820 --> 00:18:12.530
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:18:12.530 --> 00:18:14.790
Sorry for coming over so suddenly.

00:18:14.790 --> 00:18:17.730
But I'm glad to see that you're doing well.

00:18:17.730 --> 00:18:21.530
Oh yeah, I forgot I wanted to show you this!

00:18:21.530 --> 00:18:24.370
You gave this to me with your
shoulder-pounding coupons.

00:18:24.370 --> 00:18:26.210
Wow, I was so little.

00:18:26.210 --> 00:18:28.110
How embarrassing.

00:18:28.110 --> 00:18:30.310
Well, I have this to show to you.

00:18:30.310 --> 00:18:32.450
It's a picture I took with everyone.

00:18:32.450 --> 00:18:36.580
I figured there weren't any recent
pictures of me at home.

00:18:36.580 --> 00:18:37.980
Thank you.

00:18:37.980 --> 00:18:40.610
I guess I'll give you a picture of us too.

00:18:41.390 --> 00:18:43.180
Yuno!
We'll visit again!

