slices in the same way.

00:19:10.520 --> 00:19:11.520
Huh?

00:19:11.520 --> 00:19:13.450
How unusual.

00:19:13.450 --> 00:19:15.820
That's the first time I've seen this.

00:19:15.820 --> 00:19:19.280
What?! Isn't that normal?!

00:19:21.230 --> 00:19:23.330
I'm glad we stopped by.

00:19:23.330 --> 00:19:25.430
Yeah, I'm glad.

00:19:25.430 --> 00:19:27.830
She's doing well.

00:19:27.830 --> 00:19:30.130
Yes, she is.

00:19:31.070 --> 00:19:33.570
I'm glad they were all nice girls.

00:19:33.570 --> 00:19:37.370
Yeah, I'm glad that she's surrounded
by wonderful people.

00:19:39.810 --> 00:19:41.680
Aside from one of them.

00:19:41.680 --> 00:19:43.310
Yeah...

00:19:45.380 --> 00:19:47.690
I gave him those coupons when
I was in preschool.

00:19:47.690 --> 00:19:49.960
I was surprised he still had them.

00:19:49.960 --> 00:19:55.160
Your dad was probably really happy to get his
back pounded by his precious only daughter.

00:19:55.160 --> 00:19:58.100
They also said good things about
the shoes I made today.

00:19:58.100 --> 00:20:00.970
It's well done; it looks real.

00:20:00.970 --> 00:20:05.000
Even Sae couldn't tell!

00:20:05.000 --> 00:20:06.630
Shut up!

00:20:08.740 --> 00:20:10.710
At this hour?

00:20:10.710 --> 00:20:13.180
Wh-Who is it?

00:20:13.180 --> 00:20:16.310
It's me! Please open up!

00:20:17.920 --> 00:20:19.540
Ms. Yoshinoya!

00:20:20.090 --> 00:20:22.560
Yuno, so this is where you were.

00:20:22.560 --> 00:20:23.860
Y-Yeah...

00:20:23.860 --> 00:20:27.530
Your parents came to see me this evening.

00:20:27.530 --> 00:20:29.600
You have such wonderful parents!

00:20:29.600 --> 00:20:31.800
Huh? They went to your house?!

00:20:31.800 --> 00:20:32.900
Yes!

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:38.540
They told me to look after you,

00:20:38.540 --> 00:20:42.910
so I told them that your mind and
body were safe with me!

00:20:42.910 --> 00:20:44.940
What?!

00:20:44.940 --> 00:20:46.850
Aside from one of them.

00:20:46.850 --> 00:20:48.210
Yeah...

00:20:48.210 --> 00:20:50.180
You came to tell us that?

00:20:50.180 --> 00:20:55.810
Greeting parents is very important.

00:20:56.860 --> 00:20:59.460
I'm really glad I got to meet them.

00:20:59.460 --> 00:21:03.420
You get your warm-heartedness
from them, didn't you?

00:21:06.470 --> 00:21:10.270
Yuno's mother made some kinpira.

00:21:10.270 --> 00:21:11.870
Care to have some?

00:21:11.870 --> 00:21:13.670
I'd be glad to!

00:21:15.370 --> 00:21:17.170
Goodnight!

00:21:18.080 --> 00:21:20.480
Thanks for everything today.

00:21:20.480 --> 00:21:21.750
It was nothing.

00:21:21.750 --> 00:21:26.790
Yuno, if you ever have any problems,
you can talk to me.

00:21:26.790 --> 00:21:28.850
Okay!

00:21:28.850 --> 00:21:30.220
You too, Miyako.

00:21:30.220 --> 00:21:31.820
Okay!

00:21:31.820 --> 00:21:34.060
Take care, Ms. Yoshinoya.

00:21:34.060 --> 00:21:36.560
I will. Well, see you tomorrow.

00:21:36.560 --> 00:21:40.730
Goodnight!

00:21:46.610 --> 00:21:52.740
I'm surprised that Mom and Dad went
to Ms. Yoshinoya's place.

00:21:57.220 --> 00:22:02.850
Ever since I came to the Hidamari Apartments,
I've been able to do a lot by myself.

00:22:03.460 --> 00:22:06.760
I'm sure the two of them take comfort in that.

